{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino-Ducks Mayhem</strong>\u00a0is a twin-stick shooter with bullet heaven vibes, wrapped around duck-builder system, set in a duck-tastic world and all about surviving as long as you can while everything explodes around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/aa29bbbe22df37b13e5be5159f70548e.poster.avif?t=1766071119\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/aa29bbbe22df37b13e5be5159f70548e.webm?t=1766071119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck-building:</strong> Build out your flock, up to 4 ducklings and save more ducklings during runs to get more choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/423f371ebdabc0f3bb5a7699551e7191.poster.avif?t=1766071119\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/423f371ebdabc0f3bb5a7699551e7191.webm?t=1766071119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Take aim</strong>: Playing as the main Dino-Duck is a blast! it's a twin-stick shooter, so you'll use those controls for the core combat. Meanwhile, your adorable ducklings are busy gathering resources and helping take down nearby baddies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/6bf56f1f4c908fc7d1e769f6466df3f0.poster.avif?t=1766071119\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/6bf56f1f4c908fc7d1e769f6466df3f0.webm?t=1766071119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Meta-progression:</strong> Clear a wave, and boom! You'll snag experience to level up your stats and grab some sweet new gear.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/80f8d962b33a05bdfedf7542fe6bbb9c.poster.avif?t=1766071119\" width=780 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/80f8d962b33a05bdfedf7542fe6bbb9c.webm?t=1766071119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forging: </strong>Forge unique and powerful weapons. Update them for better stats with shards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/66663650604c538327f89349067aa6d0.poster.avif?t=1766071119\" width=780 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/extras/66663650604c538327f89349067aa6d0.webm?t=1766071119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3676840?t=1766071119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/0f5eb47a723f14cfeeb2cf58f53737f807622324/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766071119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676840/3268a942cbf95afad646dd7f64fa6dbdc026021a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766071119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/